{"id":"n90335-1-7","stage":1,"title":"세탁 · 洗衣","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90335-1-7-1","ko":"엄마, 제 운동복 좀 빨아야겠는데요.","zh":"妈妈，我的运动服得洗洗了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"운동복","meaning":"运动服","explanation":"운동복：运动服","readings":[{"term":"운동복","audio":"/audio/ac0c7768c4e0fa010049.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26683","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"운동복","audio":"/audio/ac0c7768c4e0fa010049.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"빨아야겠는데요.","meaning":"洗","explanation":"빨다：洗；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"빨다","audio":"/audio/6d3502c99e709c97953b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65866","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빨아야겠는데요","audio":"/audio/834f1000cde9ae9c7532.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ac0c7768c4e0fa01","term":"운동복","zh":"运动服","audio":"/audio/ac0c7768c4e0fa010049.mp3","entryId":"26683","definition":"运动时穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["운ː동복"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6d3502c99e709c97","term":"빨다","zh":"洗","audio":"/audio/6d3502c99e709c97953b.mp3","entryId":"65866","definition":"将衣服等放在水里，用手揉搓或用洗衣机除去污渍。","pronunciation":["빨다"]}],"audio":"/audio/973214bc1eaa06c612c5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90335-1-7-2","ko":"진작 말을 하지. 벌써 세탁을 다 해 버렸는걸.","zh":"早该说的啊。早就已经洗完啦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"진작","meaning":"早就，早点","explanation":"진작：早就，早点","readings":[{"term":"진작","audio":"/audio/e4dbf78e1fc6f36f0124.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77440","senseId":"1","lemma":"진작","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진작","audio":"/audio/e4dbf78e1fc6f36f0124.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"하지.","meaning":"说（话、意见或故事）","explanation":"하다：说（话、意见或故事）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"28","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"세탁을","meaning":"洗衣","explanation":"세탁：洗衣；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"세탁","audio":"/audio/aeda9b2c715772972bb8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90335","senseId":"1","lemma":"세탁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세탁을","audio":"/audio/d345d511dc265bcc945a.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"버렸는걸.","meaning":"做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）","explanation":"버리다：做完、彻底结束（-아/어 버리다，可带遗憾或痛快语气）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는걸：表示新发现、感叹或与对方预期不同的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"버렸는걸","audio":"/audio/d7ba2871f49459acdd3c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e4dbf78e1fc6f36f","term":"진작","zh":"早就，早点","audio":"/audio/e4dbf78e1fc6f36f0124.mp3","entryId":"77440","definition":"稍微提前地；或指那时已经。","pronunciation":["진ː작"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"话，语言","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的行为或态度。","pronunciation":["말ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"说（话、意见或故事）；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"说（话、意见或故事）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌